OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over large-scale drugs
OL,4,Aenterprise
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been sentenced after more
OL,7,Fthan 34kg of drugs and 41 boxes of
OL,8,Fstolen cornflakes were seized during
OL,9,Fraids across West Yorkshire.
OL,11,FLeeds Crown Court heard on Friday how
OL,12,FKyle Bates, 34, spearheaded the drugs
OL,13,Fenterprise and worked with his
OL,14,Fstepfather Alan Tonks, his stepbrother
OL,15,FShane Gray, his cousin Mark Bates and
OL,16,FMark's neighbour Reece Britnell to deal
OL,17,Fdrugs nationwide.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
