OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over large-scale drugs
OL,4,Aenterprise
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Significant amounts" of cannabis,
OL,7,Fketamine and cocaine were seized from
OL,8,Fproperties linked to the group in
OL,9,FPontefract and Darrington, alongside
OL,10,FRolex watches and weapons.
OL,12,FThe court heard during one of the raids
OL,13,FKyle Bates told officers, "What's up?
OL,14,FIt's only weed," before throwing
OL,15,Fcannabis out of a window.
